Z||000000||rigdonhome||08-19-2001||07:47 PM||||Does anyone know what was changed for 1988 that caused the 5hp drop for the 2.8L V6?  It went from 140hp in 1987 to 135hp in 1988.<P>------------------<BR>Scott Rigdon<BR>1988 Fiero GT, Black<BR>5 speed<BR>38,000 Original Miles!<BR>Cherry!||||reg||6
Z||000001||fiero56||08-19-2001||07:51 PM||||Pontiac dynoed the engines at a lower rpm to meet emissions.<P>They still peaked 140hp.||||reg||1
